{
  "about": [
    "SHARED BODY PARTS: groups of parts that fit any generated car, because the game builds them from",
    "the car's own measurements (a wing stands on that car's boot, a scoop follows that car's bonnet).",
    "A car's kit.json takes one with  { \"use\": \"rims\" }  (and may leave options out: \"without\": [ids]).",
    "Parts that must match one car's bodywork (bumpers, lamps) are NOT here: they are in that car's kit.json.",
    "Format and the fields a part may change: src/vehicles/carLook.js. Names: names.json under \"parts\"."
